ENTRY            G3150   20260916   20261124   20261124       G061
SUBENT        G3150001   20260916   20261124   20261124       G061
BIB                 16         37
TITLE      Measurement of flux-weighted average cross sections of
           natIn(g,xn) reactions and isomeric yield ratios of
           112mg,111m,g,110m,gIn with bremsstrahlung
AUTHOR     (Md.S.Rahman, K.Kim, T.H.Nguyen, G.N.Kim, H.Naik,
            S.C.Yang, S.G.Shin, Y.U.Kye, M.H.Cho)
INSTITUTE  (3KORKNU,3INDTRM,3KORKAE,3KORPUE)
REFERENCE  (J,EPJ/A,56,235,2020)
FACILITY   (LINAC,3KORPUE) Pohang Accelerator Laboratory (PAL)
INC-SOURCE (BRST) Pulsed electron beam on thin tungsten target
            (size 10 cm x 10 cm, thickness 0.1 mm)
SAMPLE     nat indium (thickness: 0.1 mm, weight: 160.63+/-0.16
            mg, size: 1.5 cm x 1.5 cm)
METHOD     (ACTIV,GSPEC) Irradiated for 2.2, 1.3 and 1.1 hours
            with the bremsstrahlung end-point energies 50
            (16+/-3 mA), 60 (17+/-3 mA) and 70 (20+/-3 mA) MeV at
            frequency of 15 Hz and a pulse width of 1.6 micro-sec
DETECTOR   (HPGE) Detection efficiency of 20% relative to a 7.6 cm
            diameter x 7.6 cm length NaI(Tl) detector and energy
            resolution of 1.8 keV FWHM at 1332.5 keV peak of 60Co
MONITOR    (79-AU-197(G,N)79-AU-196,,SIG,,BRA)
            - Au foil (thickness:0.1 mm, weight: 277.3+/-0.3 mg)
DECAY-MON  (79-AU-196-G,6.183D,DG,332.98,0.229,
                               DG,355.68,0.87)
MONIT-REF  (,H.Naik+,J,NP/A,948,28,2016)
REL-REF    (R,,R.B.Firestone+,B,FIRESTONE,,,1999) Decay data
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) Total uncertainty                   (9.1-14.4%)
           (ERR-S,1.,16.) counting statistics              (1-16%)
           (ERR-1) photon flux                               (12%)
           (ERR-2) detection efficiency                      (~3%)
           (ERR-3,1.,2.) coincidence summing correction     (1-2%)
           (ERR-4) irradiation time                         (0.5%)
           (ERR-5,0.,2.) decay time correction              (0-2%)
           (ERR-6,2.,3.) peak selection method              (2-3%)
           (ERR-7,2.,5.) beam energy and current            (2-5%)
           (ERR-8) half-life and gamma-ray abundances        (~2%)
STATUS     (APRVD) Approved by G.N.Kim (2026-09-16)
HISTORY    (20260916C) S.C.Yang
ENDBIB              37
COMMON               4          3
ERR-1      ERR-2      ERR-4      ERR-8
PER-CENT   PER-CENT   PER-CENT   PER-CENT
12.        3.         0.5        2.
ENDCOMMON            3
